[{"client_msg_id":"6350bf2d-316a-4853-ac3d-746bcb9d2ecc","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"今の所ft=jsonの時に\n• (必要なら)jsonのlsを切る\n• tomlのlsを起動\n• jsonToTomlのcommandを呼ぶ\nみたいなコマンドを定義するというイメージでいました","ts":"1632753497.186400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WK6n8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ea88674-56b4-4482-9679-facd535c9c42","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あぁ。toml だって言ってるけど、中身は json だと一応 LS には届くのか。\nファイル開いた瞬間に diagnostic で怒られまくりそうですけども。","ts":"1632753097.182800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SPc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2385e753-4104-4965-88d0-ec18c4bb1d2b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"toml の LSP が複数 filetype 動くのならありかも(deno は動かないので LS 次第かもです)","ts":"1632752862.181900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zSJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f800b758-b3c3-4433-b285-3d579cb78aa3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"json.toml みたいな ft にするとかですかね？","ts":"1632752667.180900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Ne"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01ad739f-8d48-42b1-80b1-1cbf40b50193","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"lsp_buffer_enabled だと toml のみしか発火しないだろうし。","ts":"1632752629.180500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"byZA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6fbc186-af8d-4c87-be82-90b7c9f03e1b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あーでもこれ autoload に入るんだろうか…。","ts":"1632752614.180000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HAz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8abf92b8-7077-4a22-a84f-cf82894d4934","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ユーザーに自分でコマンド定義してねってさせるのもあり？","ts":"1632752532.179400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q0WpZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"549c0a71-27a0-4b40-91a2-5f87bccdfd68","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"拡張子の問題はありますがfiletype detect のautocmdを用意する？","ts":"1632752491.178600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kK1xa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0740cc4b-2e79-4d78-9de6-02c538fc2869","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"denoやrust-analyzerの設定を参考にしてlsp_buffer_enabledのタイミングでコマンドを登録させているんですがlsp_setupとかで登録することになるんですかね\ntomlじゃないのにtomlのls動くの気持ち悪いんですが \u003c@U78A6ESHM\u003e さんに頂いたものと合わせてちょっと試してみます","ts":"1632752424.176600","edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1632752497.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=rD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e017d739-cdde-48b7-8703-5cba25335cef","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"もしくは何らかのルールに一致したら、json-language-server を無効にするか…","ts":"1632752286.173000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vZIy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3ff8efc-aa03-4c33-928b-f3d992ec31d0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ft が違うのを同時に動かしたいと言うことですよね…。\nJSON ファイルを開く(ft=json) → taplo/jsonToToml コマンドを動かす → 動いた結果が toml(ft=toml) になる。\njsonToToml が動くのは ft=toml の時だけですよね。\n何らかのルールに則って、json が ft=toml と詐称するくらいしか思い付かない…。何かいい方法ないですかねぇ。","ts":"1632752129.169900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PPIqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90e0873b-20e3-4b94-a034-c04b7ee0b5bd","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"一応 \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/470|https://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/470\u003e こんな感じでtomlToJsonは動くのですが、手もとではjsonToTomlはtomlToJsonで生成されたファイルでしか使えない、といった感じです","ts":"1632750623.166000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qr0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf7bff46-3bf5-45f2-9c23-6fb3a017841f","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"毎度すみません\ntaploにtaplo/jsonToToml (名前の通りjsonをtomlにします)という独自コマンドかあるのですが、これをvim-lsp-settingsにおいて有効に出来たらいいなと思っています。\nただjsonを開くと当然json-language-serverが有効になるので困っています。\n同時にこれら2つを有効にする方法が自分には思い付かなかったのですが何か上手い方法があったりするんでしょうか？","ts":"1632750445.162600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oa2f"}]}]
